{"ID":"20230925154154-x06ohkh","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20230925154154-x06ohkh","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230925154154-x06ohkh\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230925154206-14mwdyk\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230925154206-chkxphp\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230925154208-zqixroe\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:0\u0026#125;","title":"【当归赤豆散】","type":"doc","updated":"20230925154208"},"Children":[{"ID":"20230925154206-14mwdyk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925154206-14mwdyk","updated":"20230925154206"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"组成：赤小豆三升（浸令毛，出曝乾）、当归十两"}]},{"ID":"20230925154206-4or2pu1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925154206-4or2pu1","updated":"20230925154206"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"右二味，杵为散，浆水和服方寸匙，日三服。"}]},{"ID":"20230925154208-zqixroe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925154208-zqixroe"}},{"ID":"20230925154206-chkxphp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925154206-chkxphp","updated":"20230925154206"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【15.7】下血，先血而便者，此近血也，赤豆当归散主之。"}]}]}